   <notesStmt>
    <note type="project" target="#dat1">This manuscript was likely composed in May of 1872, shortly before the publication of <hi rend="italic">As a Strong Bird on Pinions Free. And Other Poems</hi>, which was deposited for copyright on August 26, 1872. The preface to the book, to which this manuscript likely contributed, is dated May 31, 1872.</note>
    
     <note type="work_relations" target="xxx.00527" cert="high">
       <p>This manuscript is probably part of an early draft of the preface to <hi rend="italic">As a Strong Bird on Pinions Free. And Other Poems</hi>, a slender volume—consisting of a preface and seven poems—published in 1872. The book was printed on the occasion of Whitman's delivery of a commencement poem to a group of Dartmouth College seniors in June 1872. The preface was reprinted, with minor changes, as "Preface, 1872, to 'As a Strong Bird on Pinions Free'" in the 1892 volume <hi rend="italic">Complete Prose Works</hi>.</p>
     </note>
