   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="tex_km.00003.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <p>Americans are charged with 
    <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><subst xml:id="a001"><del rend="overstrike" seq="2"><add place="supralinear" seq="1">disproportionate</add></del><del rend="overstrike" seq="4"><add place="supralinear" seq="3">national</add></del><add place="supralinear" seq="5">excessive</add></subst> 
    brag and vanity, 
    <del rend="overstrike">about</del> 
    but it seems to me on the contrary that few 
    <add place="supralinear" xml:id="a002"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">almost</del> or none yet</add> 
    realize the momentous 
    <del rend="overstrike">
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">nature</del>
      <add place="supralinear" seq="2">grandeur</add>
     </subst> 
     of our national attitude in the 
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">great</del>
      <add place="supralinear" seq="2">vast</add>
     </subst> 
     course importance of 
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the United</del>
      <add place="supralinear" seq="2">These</add>
     </subst> 
     States, 
     <subst>
      <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">in</del>
      <add place="supralinear" seq="2">or</add>
     </subst> 
     the</del> 
    <subst>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">altitude</del>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="3">
      <add place="supralinear" seq="2">d</add></del><add place="supralinear" seq="4">dominant</add></subst>
    and <subst>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del>
     <add place="supralinear" seq="2">leading</add></subst> 
    part 
    <subst>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">they</del>
     <add place="supralinear" seq="2">The States</add>
    </subst> are 
    <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">destined to play</del>
     <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add>
     <add place="supralinear" seq="3" xml:id="a003">henceforth to play &amp; are already playing</add>
    </subst> 
    in the 
    <subst>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">colossal, eternal</del>
     <add place="supralinear" seq="2">entire</add>
    </subst> 
    drama of human 
    <subst hand="#h03">
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1"><choice><sic>developemnt</sic><corr>development</corr></choice></del>
     <add place="supralinear" seq="2">progress</add></subst>, 
    stretching through time. It seems as though 
    <del rend="overstrike">all</del> 
    the past, for ten-thousand years, in Asia and Europe, through 
    <add place="below">
     <metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="supralinear" xml:id="a004">all</add> 
    the oriental and 
    <add place="below">
     <metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="supralinear" xml:id="a005">classic</add> 
    feudal ages, ha<seg xml:id="alt001">d</seg><add place="supralinear" hand="#h03" xml:id="alt002">s</add><alt target="#alt001 #alt002"/> 
    been but a series of 
    <subst>
     <add place="below" seq="1"><metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h03" seq="2"><add place="supralinear" xml:id="a006" seq="1">progressive</add></del> 
     <add place="supralinear" hand="#h03" seq="2">successive</add>
    </subst>
    evolutions, 
    <del rend="overstrike">continuing on through their time,</del> 
    steadily leading 
    <subst>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">onward</del>
     <add place="supralinear" seq="2">on and on</add>
    </subst> 
    to culminate 
    <del rend="overstrike">in the present United</del>
    <add place="supralinear">here 
     <del rend="overstrike">in These</del>
    </add> 
    <del rend="overstrike">States</del>. To 
    <subst>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">us</del>
     <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="3">
      <add place="supralinear" seq="2" xml:id="a009">The U.S.</add>
     </del>
     <add place="supralinear" seq="4">us to day</add>
    </subst> 
    <del rend="overstrike">seem I say</del> seems to be entrusted, not only the
    <subst>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">future of</del>
     <add place="supralinear" seq="2">welfare of generations to come</add>
    </subst> 
    Humanity, but in a profound sense the 
    <del rend="overstrike">past</del> 
    proof 
    <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="supralinear" xml:id="a007">&amp; fruit</add> 
    of 
    <subst>
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">all</del><add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a008">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="supralinear" xml:id="a008" seq="2">the <add place="supralinear" seq="3"><unclear reason="illegible" cert="high" resp="#km">entire</unclear></add> Humanity</add> 
    </subst> 
    that has <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">been; </del><add seq="2">preceded us;</add></subst></p>
   
   <ab>Sail<subst rend="overwrite"><del>!</del><add>&#8212;</add></subst><subst rend="overwrite"><del>s</del><add>S</add></subst>ail thy best</ab>
   
   <note type="authorial" place="bottom" hand="#h01">p. 3 "As a Strong Bird"</note>
   
   <note type="authorial" place="bottom" hand="#h02">?</note>
   
